{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-3","kind":"proposition","title":"从长线段截取与短线段相等的部分","englishTitle":"Given two unequal straight lines, to cut off from the greater a straight line equal to the less.","book":1,"number":3,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.3","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.3/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":3,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-3@raw-9c99276a28ef147c","contentId":"euclid-1-3","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c99276a28ef147c356fc6d438d2d2bc4fed70480cf5796d95459ae459e9d5f8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-3.statement","euclid-1-3.construction.1","euclid-1-3.proof.1","euclid-1-3.proof.2","euclid-1-3.proof.3","euclid-1-3.conclusion","euclid-1-3.historical.1","euclid-1-3.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-3.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-3","revisionId":"euclid-1-3@raw-9c99276a28ef147c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8407c8ff7cf53f298b49fd91fe13408bf1f5d06daf8d0439619dea4cc0c43c4d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Given two unequal straight lines, to cut off from the greater a straight line equal to the less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以两条不均匀的直线 切断大线 直线等于小线"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线，一长一短，求于长线减去短线之度"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两条直线，一条长一条短，求长线减去短线的程度"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-3.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-3","revisionId":"euclid-1-3@raw-9c99276a28ef147c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11bb2096fcc567dce1e3e09392d67d58dff62bd8212fa42c74b4a66f746328d8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, C be the-two given unequal straight lines, and let AB be the greater of them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,C, 以不平等的直线为两条, 以AB为大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-3.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-3","revisionId":"euclid-1-3@raw-9c99276a28ef147c","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d72e7abf7b89ed08a84e3e741bdbd09c422d2f76056254aae01f59a5d7126587","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus it is required to cut off from AB the greater a straight line equal to C the less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,要求将一条直线从AB大数量中截断,等于C小数量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-3.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-3","revisionId":"euclid-1-3@raw-9c99276a28ef147c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b55586b8c1807bcc61fcb047cc373ff66bc02b7a77835905d7b069115fa2e103","citations":["euclid-1-2","euclid-1-post-3","euclid-1-def-15","euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"At the point A let AD be placed equal to the straight line C; [[I. 2](/principles/euclid-1-2)] and with centre A and distance AD let the circle DEF be described. [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)] Now, since the point A is the centre of the circle DEF, AE is equal to AD. [[Def. 15](/principles/euclid-1-def-15)] But C is also equal to AD. Therefore each of the straight lines AE, C is equal to AD; so that AE is also equal to C. [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A let AD 设置为直线 C ; 中点 A 和 距离 AD 描述 DEF 圆。 现在,由于A 点是 DEF 圆的中心, AE 等于 AD 。 但 C 也 等于 AD 。 因此, AE 条直线每条等于 AD ; 因此, AE 也等于 C 。 [[I. 2](/principles/euclid-1-2)] [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)] [[Def. 15](/principles/euclid-1-def-15)] [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-3.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-3","revisionId":"euclid-1-3@raw-9c99276a28ef147c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7ed3b709cc6653fcd0fd50a34c2bee996be323de60067903177fd94578092ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, given the two straight lines AB, C, from AB the greater AE has been cut off equal to C the less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,鉴于AB直线,C,AE较大数量被切断,等于C小数量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-3.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-3","revisionId":"euclid-1-3@raw-9c99276a28ef147c","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4ec7554215d9139a4b15f0189508b6eee6efdfa12271ab024eb98a0523f5185","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"(Being) what it was required to do."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这正是所要求作的图形；作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-3.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-3","revisionId":"euclid-1-3@raw-9c99276a28ef147c","order":6,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dee678d2c590b3d3539454e8a55a1893d00263fa6e8772f89bcdb00d87f25adf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线，一长一短，求于长线减去短线之度"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两条直线，一条长一条短，求长线减去短线的程度"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-3.source","contentId":"euclid-1-3","revisionId":"euclid-1-3@raw-9c99276a28ef147c","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6639e781c5d71411d0f9fcc69fad72231e679d9de9bb250571f87f7ea83de530","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.3/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.3\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-3:euclid-1-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-3.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"I. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-3:euclid-1-post-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-3.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-post-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"Post. 3"}},{"id":"edge: